WEBVTT

01:45.350 --> 01:46.690
<i>I have to save her...</i>

01:48.330 --> 01:50.020
<i>Save her?</i>

01:50.020 --> 01:51.130
<i>How?</i>

01:54.020 --> 01:55.570
<i>I'll be killed...</i>

01:55.570 --> 01:56.640
<i>But...</i>

01:56.640 --> 01:58.770
<i>I have to save Asari-san.</i>

01:58.770 --> 02:00.390
<i>If I die, I can't save her.</i>

02:02.000 --> 02:04.350
I can save her, of course.

02:04.350 --> 02:06.560
I can do anything.

02:07.330 --> 02:08.190
<i>How?</i>

02:08.730 --> 02:13.110
My power. The power of the DEATH NINJA.

02:13.110 --> 02:15.070
Now... Use it!

02:15.800 --> 02:17.150
<i>My power...</i>

02:17.620 --> 02:19.980
Unleash it on your foes.

02:19.980 --> 02:22.620
There's no need to think about it.

02:22.620 --> 02:24.700
This is SAYŌNARA!

02:25.570 --> 02:27.000
<i>From now on I...</i>

02:27.000 --> 02:28.620
...am me!

02:28.620 --> 02:29.500
Now!

02:30.040 --> 02:31.000
SAYŌNARA!

02:31.000 --> 02:31.750
YEEART!

02:32.020 --> 02:33.500
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

02:33.930 --> 02:34.500
YEART!

02:34.500 --> 02:36.460
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

02:41.280 --> 02:43.110
<i>What is...</i>

02:43.110 --> 02:44.000
<i>...this?</i>

03:02.880 --> 03:04.950
<i>Those weren't my emotions...</i>

03:04.950 --> 03:06.120
<i>Something inside me...</i>

03:06.910 --> 03:08.370
<i>No.</i>

03:08.370 --> 03:09.460
<i>Now...</i>

03:10.040 --> 03:11.620
<i>They're my feelings.</i>

03:12.660 --> 03:14.290
Yamoto-san...

03:25.180 --> 03:26.570
Asari-SAN.

03:27.930 --> 03:29.420
It's okay now.

03:29.420 --> 03:30.730
Let's go home.

03:30.730 --> 03:34.690
LAST GIRL STANDING

03:34.690 --> 03:34.730
AKABAKI BUSHIDO HIGH SCHOOL

03:37.690 --> 03:37.730
Push to

03:37.690 --> 03:37.730
signal stop

03:38.160 --> 03:40.190
Good morning, Yamoto-san.

03:41.110 --> 03:42.910
This is my first day here.

03:42.910 --> 03:45.060
DŌMO, Asari-SAN.

03:45.060 --> 03:46.410
Me too.

03:46.410 --> 03:46.450
Push to

03:46.410 --> 03:46.450
signal stop

03:49.510 --> 03:52.420
Do you know that guy in the back seat?

03:53.510 --> 03:55.920
I don't know any scary thugs like that.

03:56.440 --> 03:58.040
I've never seen him before.

03:58.040 --> 04:00.300
He might be a transfer student.

04:21.910 --> 04:24.510
Screw you, asshole!

04:21.910 --> 04:24.510
Hrgh rargh blargh!

04:24.510 --> 04:26.820
Argle bargle!

04:24.510 --> 04:26.820
Rhubarb! Rhubarb!

04:26.820 --> 04:31.580
Hrgrgnrg!

04:30.730 --> 04:31.580
That's...

04:31.580 --> 04:33.710
The guy from this morning!

04:35.710 --> 04:37.570
Come on!

04:37.570 --> 04:39.400
Let's get this over with.

04:39.400 --> 04:40.640
It's lunchtime.

04:40.640 --> 04:42.380
Screw you, asshole!

04:43.110 --> 04:44.240
NAMU SAN!

04:44.240 --> 04:45.730
Ah, behold!

04:45.730 --> 04:49.260
Everyone thought his head would be crushed like a tomato,

04:49.260 --> 04:50.970
but it wasn't!

04:50.970 --> 04:53.710
You're all going to die.

04:54.710 --> 04:55.930
He's...

04:55.930 --> 04:56.980
What's wrong?

04:56.980 --> 04:59.420
The strange feeling in Yamoto's chest grew.

04:59.420 --> 05:02.480
The man with the afro hair was like her.

05:02.480 --> 05:05.420
A strange certainty overcame her.

05:05.420 --> 05:07.860
And she was, in fact, correct.

05:07.860 --> 05:11.410
Yamoto had sensed his NINJA SOUL.

05:07.860 --> 05:11.410
NOTE: NINJA SOUL is the SOUL of a NINJA.

05:11.410 --> 05:14.410
Argle bargle!

05:11.410 --> 05:14.410
Rhubarb! Rhubarb!

05:17.170 --> 05:18.150
Rargh rargh rargh!

05:18.150 --> 05:19.590
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

05:29.910 --> 05:31.330
That hurts!

05:31.330 --> 05:33.100
<i>I'm</i> the victim here!

05:38.200 --> 05:40.660
I just got here!

05:42.060 --> 05:44.060
DŌMO, Shōgo-SAN.

05:44.060 --> 05:47.780
I'm Fumatoni. A pleasure to meet you.

05:47.780 --> 05:49.280
Who the hell are you?

05:49.710 --> 05:53.450
I'm the man who's getting you out of here. Or if you prefer...

05:53.450 --> 05:57.580
You can stay and be the prime suspect in a mass murder case.

05:58.910 --> 06:01.750
Okay, I'll stay a suspect.

06:01.750 --> 06:03.670
Hold on, hold on.

06:03.970 --> 06:08.880
There are some things I can't say here.

06:08.880 --> 06:10.550
Say them.

06:12.170 --> 06:13.980
AHBAHBAHBAHBAHBAHHH!

06:14.730 --> 06:17.040
Tsk. You rabid dog.

06:17.040 --> 06:18.910
YEEART!

06:17.440 --> 06:18.910
UWARRGGH!

06:19.620 --> 06:24.130
You think your puny NINJA SOUL makes you the king of the world or something?

06:24.130 --> 06:25.770
Equal terms.

06:24.130 --> 06:25.770
NOTE: Equal Terms means "50 Steps 100 Steps"

06:24.130 --> 06:25.770
NOTE: 50 Steps 100 Steps means "Gojuppo Hyappo"

06:24.130 --> 06:25.770
NOTE: Gojuppo Hyappo means "Equal Terms"

06:25.770 --> 06:28.700
In our world, you're just a wimpy kid.

06:29.240 --> 06:31.600
I'll give you my AISATSU once more.

06:31.600 --> 06:34.200
DŌMO, Shōgo-SAN.

06:34.200 --> 06:37.870
I am Sonic Boom, one of the SŌKAI SIX GATES NINJAS.

06:38.310 --> 06:39.960
A NINJA?

06:39.960 --> 06:41.820
It's time to make a choice.

06:41.820 --> 06:46.050
You can come with me to the Syndicate,
or you can die here.

06:46.620 --> 06:48.470
Choose. Now.

06:58.220 --> 07:00.560
DŌMO, Shōgo-SAN.

07:01.150 --> 07:03.440
If you die, it's all over.

07:03.970 --> 07:04.730
Who are you?

07:05.440 --> 07:07.770
I am PUNK NINJA.

07:05.440 --> 07:07.770
NOTE: PUNK is a type of MUSIC.

07:07.770 --> 07:11.820
I was born in London, and died in 1979.

07:11.820 --> 07:14.330
I died in an unbelievably stupid way.

07:14.330 --> 07:17.020
But from now on, you're me!

07:17.020 --> 07:18.540
You won't die.

07:18.860 --> 07:19.840
Stop it!

07:19.840 --> 07:20.670
I want to die!

07:20.670 --> 07:22.510
I won't let you die!

07:22.510 --> 07:23.910
You are me!

07:23.910 --> 07:25.170
From now on, you are...

07:25.170 --> 07:27.050
NINJA

07:27.050 --> 07:28.800
Stop!

08:05.920 --> 08:08.400
I'd prefer to stop this here.

08:08.400 --> 08:09.170
Still wanna fight?

08:09.170 --> 08:12.750
We're sorry! Please keep this a secret!

08:12.750 --> 08:14.040
Please...

08:14.040 --> 08:15.220
It's fine.

08:15.220 --> 08:16.730
Never do it again, okay?

08:16.730 --> 08:18.720
W-With pleasure!

08:22.310 --> 08:24.600
<i>He's like me...</i>

08:25.880 --> 08:27.330
<i>Like me?</i>

08:36.130 --> 08:37.740
Yamoto-san!

08:37.740 --> 08:39.000
Are you okay?

08:39.000 --> 08:42.500
Everybody said they saw guys from a sports team take you away.

08:43.310 --> 08:45.060
They didn't do anything to me.

08:45.060 --> 08:46.380
It's fine.

08:47.330 --> 08:49.690
<i>I guess our roles are reversed this time.</i>

08:50.310 --> 08:51.340
Anyway...

08:51.340 --> 08:53.440
You had something to ask me, right?

08:54.260 --> 08:59.010
Yamoto-san, the teacher told me you did origami at your last school.

08:59.550 --> 09:00.600
Origami?

09:00.910 --> 09:03.890
They said you even went to an Inter-High tournament.

09:13.350 --> 09:14.280
Yamoto-san?

09:16.080 --> 09:17.780
Sure, of course.

09:18.330 --> 09:19.700
Thanks!

09:22.080 --> 09:25.620
Then you just blow into the gap, and it's done.

09:29.060 --> 09:31.840
Wow!

09:35.800 --> 09:37.260
DO IT. OR ELSE.

09:37.260 --> 09:38.760
NOTE: No one can read this,
but it looks very impressive.

09:39.480 --> 09:41.020
<i>How stupid.</i>

09:41.020 --> 09:44.820
<i>Some day, I'm going to murder
everyone in this stupid organization.</i>

09:46.060 --> 09:48.950
DŌMO, Shōgo-SAN.

09:49.930 --> 09:53.320
Looks like you just barely pulled it off today, huh?

09:53.660 --> 09:57.570
If you were useless again,
I was going to kill you.

09:57.570 --> 09:59.700
Tch. DŌMO.

10:02.080 --> 10:04.370
I can kill you too, now.

10:06.000 --> 10:07.750
Feel free to try.

10:07.750 --> 10:11.130
Suicide

10:11.730 --> 10:13.660
This is your name.

10:13.660 --> 10:15.920
I'm your godfather.

10:15.920 --> 10:17.720
So you'd better be grateful.

10:18.000 --> 10:20.620
Suicide. To kill one's self.

10:20.620 --> 10:24.890
It's the only name that fits, you know?

10:25.170 --> 10:27.240
You're right.

10:27.240 --> 10:29.190
But things will be different now.

10:29.680 --> 10:34.190
I will see to it that the weak never forget my afro hair.

10:34.190 --> 10:37.840
Okay. Let's get started, eh?

10:37.840 --> 10:39.440
Time for your first mission.

10:40.110 --> 10:42.320
Your target is this NINJA.

10:43.330 --> 10:44.840
NINJA?

10:44.840 --> 10:45.970
Her?

10:45.970 --> 10:50.820
The Syndicate looked into that pathetic suicide attempt of yours.

10:50.820 --> 10:54.920
We always research the circumstances behind NINJA SOUL possession.

10:54.920 --> 10:58.350
The kid you landed on is still alive.

10:58.350 --> 11:01.550
By some strange luck, she's a NINJA and a transfer student, too.

11:02.040 --> 11:03.680
It must be karma.

11:03.680 --> 11:06.440
You both become NINJAS,

11:06.440 --> 11:10.820
and you both transfer to the same high school!
